/- English proof (translation)
Replace the relevant objects with their definitions. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities. Reduce the equality to equality of the corresponding arguments. Apply function extensionality and compare values at an arbitrary argument. Apply an available result and prove the equalities needed to match it to the conclusion.

Apply function extensionality and compare values at an arbitrary argument. A detailed English derivation is pending.
-/
theorem pull_unit_class {R R' : Type} [CommRing R] [CommRing R'] {C C' : Type 1} [Category.{0} C] [Category.{0} C']
    {σ : R →+* R'} (A : C ⥤ CommAlgCat.{0} R) (A' : C' ⥤ CommAlgCat.{0} R')
    (m : CH.Mor (CH.modF A) (CH.modF A') σ)
    (h : ∀ T : C', m.τ T (1 : A.obj (m.G.obj T)) = (1 : A'.obj T)) :
    m.pull 0 (CH.oneH A) = CH.oneH A' := by
  unfold CH.Mor.pull CH.oneH
  generalize_proofs p1 p2
  rw [CrystallineSemistableComparison.P.mapH_cls]
  · congr 1
    funext s
    exact h _
  · convert p2 using 2
    funext s
    exact h _

/- English proof (translation)
